                                        {
                                          "tag": "span",
                                          "attrs": {},
                                          "children": [
                                            "The summer holidays present a valuable opportunity for students preparing for 11+ school entrance exams to refresh their knowledge and enhance their skills. While it's essential to take a break and recharge during this time, incorporating targeted study activities can significantly contribute to exam success. This blog provides guidance on how to make the most of your summer break by engaging in focused study techniques that will help you excel in the 11+ entrance exams."
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
