                                                "class": "KmEWy"
                                              },
                                              "children": [
                                                {
                                                  "tag": "span",
                                                  "attrs": {},
                                                  "children": [
                                                    "Understand the Exam Syllabus: Begin your preparation by thoroughly understanding the syllabus for the 11+ exams. Research the specific topics and subjects covered, and familiarise yourself with the exam format and requirements. This knowledge will guide your study plan and help you allocate time to each subject accordingly."
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "tag": "li",
                                      "attrs": {
                                        "dir": "auto",
                                        "aria-level": "1",
                                        "class": "FaYQD",
                                        "style": "margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "attrs": {
                                            "class": "_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG",
                                            "dir": "",
                                            "data-ricos-paragraph": "eu5c5",
                                            "id": "viewer-eu5c5",
                                            "tabindex": "-1"
                                          },
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "span",
                                              "attrs": {
                                                "class": "KmEWy"
                                              },
                                              "children": [
                                                {
                                                  "tag": "span",
                                                  "attrs": {},
                                                  "children": [
                                                    "Create a Study Schedule: Develop a study schedule that balances focused study time with relaxation and leisure activities. Dedicate specific time slots each day for subjects such as English, mathematics, verbal reasoning, and non-verbal reasoning. Breaking down your study sessions into manageable chunks will enhance concentration and prevent burnout."
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "tag": "li",
                                      "attrs": {
                                        "dir": "auto",
                                        "aria-level": "1",
                                        "class": "FaYQD",
                                        "style": "margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "attrs": {
                                            "class": "_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG",
                                            "dir": "",
                                            "data-ricos-paragraph": "pfu8",
                                            "id": "viewer-pfu8",
                                            "tabindex": "-1"
                                          },
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "span",
                                              "attrs": {
                                                "class": "KmEWy"
                                              },
                                              "children": [
                                                {
                                                  "tag": "span",
                                                  "attrs": {},
                                                  "children": [
                                                    "Utilize Practice Papers: Practice papers are invaluable resources for exam preparation. They familiarise you with the format, time constraints, and question types you will encounter in the actual exams. Start by attempting a few practice papers to identify your strengths and weaknesses. Focus on areas that require improvement, and gradually increase the difficulty level as you progress."
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "tag": "li",
                                      "attrs": {
                                        "dir": "auto",
                                        "aria-level": "1",
                                        "class": "FaYQD",
                                        "style": "margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "attrs": {
                                            "class": "_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG",
                                            "dir": "",
                                            "data-ricos-paragraph": "3lrrl",
                                            "id": "viewer-3lrrl",
                                            "tabindex": "-1"
                                          },
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "span",
                                              "attrs": {
                                                "class": "KmEWy"
                                              },
                                              "children": [
                                                {
                                                  "tag": "span",
                                                  "attrs": {},
                                                  "children": [
                                                    "Engage in Regular Reading: Reading extensively during the summer holidays will strengthen your vocabulary, comprehension skills, and general knowledge. Choose a variety of fiction and non-fiction books, newspapers, and magazines. Explore genres that you may encounter in the exams, such as adventure, historical fiction, and science. Keep a notebook to jot down new words and their meanings for later revision."
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "tag": "li",
                                      "attrs": {
                                        "dir": "auto",
                                        "aria-level": "1",
                                        "class": "FaYQD",
                                        "style": "margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "attrs": {
                                            "class": "_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG",
                                            "dir": "",
                                            "data-ricos-paragraph": "6tvre",
                                            "id": "viewer-6tvre",
                                            "tabindex": "-1"
                                          },
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "span",
                                              "attrs": {
                                                "class": "KmEWy"
                                              },
                                              "children": [
                                                {
                                                  "tag": "span",
                                                  "attrs": {},
                                                  "children": [
                                                    "Join Study Groups or Tutoring Programs: Consider joining study groups or enrolling in tutoring programs designed specifically for 11+ entrance exams. Collaborating with peers or receiving guidance from experienced tutors can provide valuable insights, personalised feedback, and motivation. Interacting with others in a focused learning environment will enhance your understanding of challenging concepts and encourage healthy competition."
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "tag": "li",
                                      "attrs": {
                                        "dir": "auto",
                                        "aria-level": "1",
                                        "class": "FaYQD",
                                        "style": "margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "attrs": {
                                            "class": "_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG",
                                            "dir": "",
                                            "data-ricos-paragraph": "9pm0p",
                                            "id": "viewer-9pm0p",
                                            "tabindex": "-1"
                                          },
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "span",
                                              "attrs": {
                                                "class": "KmEWy"
                                              },
                                              "children": [
                                                {
                                                  "tag": "span",
                                                  "attrs": {},
                                                  "children": [
                                                    "Practice Time Management: Time management is critical during exams. Use the summer holidays to develop efficient time management skills by setting timed practice sessions for each subject. Aim to complete questions within the allocated time, gradually increasing speed and accuracy. Regularly review your performance to identify areas where time management can be improved."
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "tag": "li",
                                      "attrs": {
                                        "dir": "auto",
                                        "aria-level": "1",
                                        "class": "FaYQD",
                                        "style": "margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tag": "p",
                                          "attrs": {
                                            "class": "_9Nlgm Dd46l fUDW- lqKvG",
                                            "dir": "",
                                            "data-ricos-paragraph": "fbv58",
                                            "id": "viewer-fbv58",
                                            "tabindex": "-1"
                                          },
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tag": "span",
                                              "attrs": {
                                                "class": "KmEWy"
                                              },
                                              "children": [
                                                {
                                                  "tag": "span",
                                                  "attrs": {},
                                                  "children": [
                                                    "Seek Online Resources: Leverage the vast array of online resources available for 11+ exam preparation. Websites, educational platforms, and online forums offer practice tests, study materials, interactive quizzes, and expert advice. Utilize these resources to supplement your learning and gain additional exposure to different question formats and techniques."
                                                  ]
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            }
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
