                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "tag": "span",
                                      "attrs": {
                                        "class": "KmEWy"
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tag": "span",
                                          "attrs": {},
                                          "children": [
                                            " With proper planning and focused study techniques, the summer holidays can be a productive time for students preparing for 11+ school entrance exams. By understanding the syllabus, creating a study schedule, utilizing practice papers, engaging in regular reading, joining study groups, practicing time management, and seeking online resources, you can maximize your exam preparation efforts and increase your chances of success. Remember to strike a balance between studying and relaxation, as a refreshed mind is crucial for optimal performance during exams. Best of luck with your preparation!"
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
